<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed and meal values lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed and meal values lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal prices were lower on Friday as demand slackened, several dealers said.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  110.00    117.00</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  unq	  unq</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  343.00    345.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   98.00    104.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
